Subject: [PATCH] Restrict browser file dialogs to the Documents tree

User-facing Wasm file dialogs browse only the persistent Documents tree.
Keep Qt's native directory navigation and subfolders, but omit filesystem
ancestors from the sidebar/location field, filter external symlinks and
validate typed paths before accepting. Internal virtual filesystem access
is unchanged. Upstream issue searches for a WebAssembly document-root file
dialog restriction found no matching report.

Persist native picker rename/delete operations through the existing serialized
browser-cache queue. Closing the picker also commits directory changes.
Upstream issue searches found no matching IDBFS file-picker mutation report.

Reject typed logical or backing-storage paths outside Documents, even when their canonical target has a visible cache alias. Upstream issue searches found no matching WebAssembly path-boundary report.

